              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر وہ شرمندہ ہوتا تو سر جھکاتا۔ agar voh sharmindā hotā to sar jhukātā. If he were ashamed, he would hang his head."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے سر جھکایا, us ne sar jhukāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
